Usage of grade-edition3:
  -ch int
    	Edition 3 chapter to grade (1, 4 or 5) (default 1)
  -consumer string
    	Chapter 4/5 external consumer module directory
  -consumer-case string
    	Chapter 4/5 JSON case file (default: shout example)
  -core string
    	Chapter 4/5 core source module directory
  -json
    	emit the report as JSON
  -media-models string
    	Chapter 5 media-model mapping JSON
  -workflow string
    	Chapter 5 workflow module directory
